        "section_1": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. Your agreement with us",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") are a binding agreement between you and Westboro Aspen LLC, a Massachussetts limited liability company (\"wanderWell,\" \"we,\" \"us\"). They cover your use of shopwanderwell.co, our mobile site, our emails and SMS, and any orders you place. If you don't agree with any part of these Terms, please don't use the site or buy from us.</p><p>You must be at least <strong>18 years old</strong> (or the age of majority where you live) to place an order. By checking out, you confirm you meet that bar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_2": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. Your account",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>You can shop as a guest, or create an account to save addresses, track orders, and manage subscriptions. If you create one:</p><ul><li>Keep your password to yourself. You're responsible for activity under your login.</li><li>Tell us right away if you think someone else got in: <a href=\"mailto:care@shopwanderwell.co\">care@shopwanderwell.co</a>.</li><li>We can suspend or close accounts that violate these Terms, with notice when practical.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "section_3": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. Orders & payment",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<h3>Order acceptance</h3><p>When you check out, you're making us an offer to buy. We accept it when we send a shipping confirmation — not when you receive an order confirmation email. Until that point, we may decline or cancel an order, including for:</p><ul><li>Items priced incorrectly because of a typo or system error</li><li>Stock we no longer have on hand</li><li>Suspected fraud or reseller activity</li><li>Shipping addresses we don't serve</li></ul><p>If we cancel after charging you, we refund in full within 5 business days.</p><h3>Pricing &amp; taxes</h3><p>Prices are in U.S. dollars and don't include shipping or tax. Sales tax is calculated at checkout based on your shipping address. We don't price-match.</p><h3>Payment</h3><p>We accept the major card networks plus Shop Pay, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. Stripe processes payment; we never see your full card number. If a payment fails (declined card, insufficient funds), your order won't ship until it clears.</p><h3>Promo codes &amp; gift cards</h3><p>Discount codes are single-use, can't be combined unless we say otherwise, and have no cash value. We can cancel or adjust an order that used a code issued in error. Gift cards don't expire, aren't redeemable for cash, and won't be replaced if lost — treat them like cash.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_4": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Shipping & delivery",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>We ship within the contiguous United States only — we don't yet ship to Hawaii, Alaska, or internationally. Order before 3pm ET and it ships the same day; otherwise it goes out the next business day. We don't ship on weekends. Shipping is free on orders $50+; below that, cost is calculated at checkout by weight and destination. Our average order is delivered within 3–4 business days of shipping. Title and risk of loss pass to you when the carrier scans the package as <strong>delivered</strong>. Full details are on our <a href=\"shipping-returns.html\">Shipping Policy</a> page.</p><p>If your order is missing or delayed, email us at <a href=\"mailto:care@shopwanderwell.co\">care@shopwanderwell.co</a> and we'll help track it down or send a replacement if necessary.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_5": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. Returns & refunds",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Due to the ingestible nature of our products, we do not accept returns. Full details live on our <a href=\"returns-exchanges.html\">Returns &amp; Exchanges</a> page; the summary:</p><ul><li><strong>First order guarantee:</strong> not working for you? We'll refund the purchase price of your first order in full, with proof of purchase, within 30 days from the date of purchase. This applies to your first wanderWell order only.</li><li><strong>How to request:</strong> email <a href=\"mailto:care@shopwanderwell.co\">care@shopwanderwell.co</a> with your order number or proof of purchase, the product name(s), and a brief description of why you're requesting a refund.</li><li><strong>Limits:</strong> we reserve the right to limit and/or deny refunds in cases of suspected abuse or fraud, and refunds will not be given to repeat or recurring customers.</li></ul><p>All refunds issued are to the original form of payment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_6": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Subscriptions",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Subscribe &amp; Save sends a fresh box on the cadence you pick (every 30, 45, or 60 days). When you subscribe:</p><ul><li>We email you <strong>3 days</strong> before each renewal so nothing surprises you.</li><li>Subscriptions ship at 10% off with free shipping. You can pause, skip, change cadence, swap products, or cancel any time in your account or by emailing us. If your order has already been processed, changes apply to the following renewal.</li><li>Your saved card is charged on the renewal date. If it fails twice, we pause the subscription and let you know.</li><li>Subscription discounts apply only while the subscription is active. Cancelling forfeits the discount on future one-time orders.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "section_7": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. Health disclaimer",
            "heading_size": "h2",
