          "settings": {
            "title": "We make supplements, not medicine.",
            "text": "<p>Statements about wanderWell products have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. Our products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. The site is not medical advice — please talk to your doctor before starting any supplement, especially if you're pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or managing a health condition.</p>",
            "is_warning": true
