        "section_8": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "8. Acceptable use",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Please don't:</p><ul><li>Reverse-engineer, scrape, or copy substantial parts of the site</li><li>Use our brand, photography, or copy to imply endorsement we haven't given</li><li>Resell our products without a written wholesale agreement</li><li>Submit fake reviews, fraudulent orders, or chargeback abuse</li><li>Interfere with the site's security or other people's use of it</li></ul><p>We may suspend access or refuse future orders if we see this kind of behavior.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_9": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "9. Third-party links & services",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>The site may link to third-party sites (like our social channels or press mentions) and relies on third-party services that have their own terms and privacy policies. We don't control those sites or services and aren't responsible for their content, accuracy, or practices. Using them is at your own risk.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_10": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "10. Intellectual property",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Everything on shopwanderwell.co — the wanderWell name and logo, photography, copy, product designs, packaging artwork, and code — belongs to wanderWell or our licensors. Our trademarks include <strong>\"wanderWell\"</strong> and the wordmark. You get a limited, non-exclusive license to browse the site and order products for personal use. No other rights are granted.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_11": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "11. Your content",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>When you post a review, send us a photo, or tag us on social, you keep ownership but grant us a worldwide, royalty-free, perpetual license to use, display, edit lightly, and promote that content across our marketing channels. You agree your content is original (or you have rights to share it), accurate, and won't get us in legal trouble. We may remove content for any reason, including spam or harassment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_12": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "12. Warranties & disclaimers",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>EXCEPT WHERE PROHIBITED BY LAW, THE SITE AND PRODUCTS ARE PROVIDED \"AS IS\" AND \"AS AVAILABLE.\" WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DON'T WARRANT THAT THE SITE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED OR ERROR-FREE, OR THAT ANY DEFECT WILL BE CORRECTED. SOME JURISDICTIONS DON'T ALLOW THESE DISCLAIMERS, SO THEY MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_13": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "13. Limitation of liability",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, WANDERWELL AND ITS OFFICERS, EMPLOYEES, AND SUPPLIERS WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR FOR LOST PROFITS, REVENUES, OR DATA, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO THESE TERMS OR THE PRODUCTS. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM IS LIMITED TO THE GREATER OF (A) THE AMOUNT YOU PAID US IN THE TWELVE MONTHS BEFORE THE CLAIM, OR (B) ONE HUNDRED U.S. DOLLARS ($100). NOTHING IN THESE TERMS LIMITS LIABILITY THAT CAN'T BE LIMITED UNDER APPLICABLE LAW.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_14": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "14. Indemnification",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>You agree to defend and indemnify wanderWell against any claim, loss, or expense (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your misuse of the site, your violation of these Terms, or content you submit that infringes someone else's rights.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_15": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "15. Disputes & arbitration",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>If something goes wrong, our first ask is that you write to us so we can fix it. Most things get resolved that way.</p><p>For anything that doesn't, you and wanderWell agree to resolve disputes through <strong>binding individual arbitration</strong> administered by the American Arbitration Association under its Consumer Arbitration Rules, in Massachusetts (or by phone/video). You and we both waive the right to a jury trial and to participate in a class action. You may opt out of this arbitration agreement within <strong>30 days</strong> of first agreeing to these Terms by emailing <a href=\"mailto:care@shopwanderwell.co\">care@shopwanderwell.co</a> with \"Arbitration opt-out\" in the subject line. Small-claims court is always available for qualifying claims.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_16": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "16. Governing law",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the <strong>Commonwealth of Massachusetts</strong>, without regard to its conflict-of-laws rules. Except for arbitrable claims under Section 15, the state and federal courts in Massachusetts have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_17": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "17. Changes",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>We may update these Terms from time to time. If we make a material change, we'll post the updated version here and notify account holders by email at least <strong>14 days</strong> before it takes effect. Continued use of the site after the effective date means you accept the new Terms.</p>"
          }
        },
        "section_18": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "18. General provisions",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "content": "<p>These Terms, along with our <a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy Policy</a>, are the entire agreement between you and wanderWell about your use of the site. If any part of these Terms is found unenforceable, the rest stays in effect. Our failure to enforce a provision isn't a waiver of it. You can't assign these Terms to someone else; we can, as part of a merger, sale, or transfer of our business. By using the site or placing an order, you agree we can communicate with you electronically — email satisfies any legal requirement for written notice.</p>"
          }
        },
